An AI tool produced this helper for smoothing a series of readings:

```js
function averageOfNeighbors(nums) {
  const out = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
    out.push((nums[i] + nums[i + 1]) / 2);
  }
  return out;
}

averageOfNeighbors([4, 8, 12]);
```

The loop bound is the textbook one. Trace it by hand before answering.

